  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO International Symposium on Fisheries Sustainability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main outcome will be a technical document synthesizing the main outcomes of the Symposium discussions.  This document, the result of synthesizing the information and debate in each of the symposium sessions, will be prepared by the FAO Secretariat and tabled at COFI 34. It is expected that this technical document will form the basis of a high-level policy statement on the role, value and sustainability status of global and regional fisheries in the 21st century.</narrative>
  </description>
